[h2]Patch notes TL;DR [/h2]

Rejoice, trophy hunters: this update addresses the issue with certain multiplayer-related achievements having unjustifiably high requirements to obtain – they’re much easier to get now. Oh, we’ve also removed the placeholders from the locker.

[h2]List of changes[/h2]

[list]
[*] Reduced requirements for “Intern”, “Doctor” and “Doctor Without Borders” achievements from “Recover 100/1000/10000 HP” to “Recover 10/100/500 HP” respectively;
[*] Reduced requirements for “Shooter”, “Stormtrooper” and “Sniper” achievements from “Deal 100/5000/50000 damage with bullet weapons” to “Deal 50/500/1000 damage with bullet weapons” respectively;
[*] Reduced requirements for “Assistant”, “Scientist” and “Tesla” achievements from “Deal 100/5000/50000 damage with energy weapons” to “Deal 50/500/1000 damage with energy weapons” respectively;
[*] Reduced requirements for “Dynamite”, “Bomb” and “Megaton” achievements from “Deal 100/5000/50000 damage with explosives” to “Deal 50/500/1000 damage with explosives” respectively;
[*] Reduced requirements for “Surgeon”, “Sadist” and “Butcher” achievements from “Deal 100/1000/5000 damage with melee weapons” to “Deal 50/100/500 damage with melee weapons” respectively;
[*] Reduced requirements for “Disease”, “Plague” and “Epidemic” achievements from “Infect 5/100/500 humans” to “Infect 1/10/50 humans” respectively;
[*] Reduced requirements for “Novice Killer”, “Serial Killer” and “Maniac” achievements from “Kill 10/100/1000 enemies” to “Kill 5/10/50 enemies” respectively;
[*] Reduced requirements for “Rescuer”, “Protector” and “Messiah” achievements from “Save 10/100/1000 civilians” to “Save 5/10/50 civilians” respectively;
[*] Reduced requirements for “Winner”, “Unchallenged” and “Top Dog” achievements from “Win 5/20/500 battles” to “Win 1/10/50 battles” respectively;
[*] Removed a couple of placeholders from the locker.
[/list]

If you registered on the website, then check the email address you’ve specified during registration — beta-build has been sent out to all participants!

If you already own multiplayer [url=https://store.steampowered.com/app/826600]I am not a Monster[/url] — join beta-test directly from your Steam library:
[list][*] Go to your library;
[*] Right click I am not a Monster;
[*] Select Properties → Beta Tab;
[*] Select the beta-branch from a drop-down list.[/list]
Please, complete a small survey after finishing the game. We will give away keys to [url=https://store.steampowered.com/bundle/10845]any Alawar Premium game[/url] of your choice among those who completed the survey!

